External tools used but not included: Harbor (harbor-framework/harbor), Terminal-Bench, the Pi coding agent,
mini-swe-agent, vLLM, Apptainer. Their licenses apply to them.

Benchmarks: this repository ships no benchmark items. Item ID lists and download scripts fetch each benchmark from
